Overchannel commits extra maximum SP to each manual damaging working.

  Arcane 8       5 percent
  Arcane 16     10 percent
  Arcane 32     20 percent
  Arcane 500    25 percent
  Arcane 1000   30 percent

Use "overchannel <percent>" to select an open setting and "overchannel off" to
release it. The added SP is not discounted by mastery or Mezari. It becomes
additional spell power using effective Arcane and a smaller true-Arcane
prestige term.

Overchannel lasts for the current play session. It does not affect utility
workings, automatic barrage, or Echoform. A resisted or interrupted working
still spends the power committed to the attempt.
